  label: "8 · Paper signing, void and copy"
---

**Who:** the person in charge.

## Paper signing

On a **Ready** contract, upload the scanned signed copy. The contract becomes **Signed**.

{% screenshot id="crm/paper-signed" caption="Signed on paper; the history on the right lists every step." /%}

## Change a contract after sending

A contract that has gone for approval or for signing is not edited in place.

{% steps %}

1. Select **Void contract** and give the reason (required). The voided contract keeps its number and its history.
2. Create a new contract from the current services. The new contract receives a new number, for example SAF-2026-0002.

{% /steps %}

## Several contracts on one deal

Each contract on an opportunity picks its own issuing entity. Switch between the contracts with the selector at the top of the **Contract** tab.
